("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1_2_0.0", "order", "1")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1_2.2", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1_2.2", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1_2.2", "child", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1_2.2", "order", "3")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1.1", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1.1", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1.1", "child", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_1.1", "order", "2")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2", "isa", "DomNode")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2", "tag", "p")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2_0.0", "isa", "DomText")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2_0.0", "text", "The Claimipedia process-algebra work asks a careful sequence of questions: what can share a space, what carries the relationship, what remains faithful as things move, what chooses a direction, and what can be recognised afterwards.")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2_0.0", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2_0.0", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2_0.0", "child", "text.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2_0.0")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2_0.0", "order", "1")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2.2", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2.2", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2.2", "child", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_2.2", "order", "3")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_3", "isa", "DomNode")
("node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_3", "tag", "p")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_3_0.0", "isa", "DomText")
("text.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_3_0.0", "text", "For this gathering, those questions become human ones: Can everyone belong? Can we listen without taking over? Can leaders step back? Can prayer become care? Can the night leave behind repair that is visible in ordinary life?")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_3_0.0", "isa", "DomChild")
("edge.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_3_0.0", "parent", "node.htmlImported.1_1_1_1_0_3")
